WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:06.910
- There is no such thing as a superfood.

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:09.450
There are a lot of foods
that are super good for you,

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.570
and that's fine, but this title

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:15.350
of superfood is completely made up.

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:18.480
The notion of a superfood
is that is so good for you,

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.400
it will prevent cancer
and even treat cancer

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.400
or stave off evil illnesses,
but food alone cannot do that.

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:28.040
When we talk about superfoods,

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:32.280
primarily we think of berries,
foods with high antioxidants.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.210
And it's really a misnomer.

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:35.230
There is no such thing.

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:37.090
There are foods that are good for you

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:38.990
and foods that are not so good for you,

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:41.810
but the idea of a superfood treating

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:43.510
or preventing an illness is false.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:45.260
Superfoods have evolved,

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.200
and they may not have
been called superfoods,

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.730
but even back in the 1970s

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:51.880
there were the quote-unquote health foods

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.870
which were really the
superfoods of their day,

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:57.950
which included pasta.
- New Catelli pasta.

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.853
It's made with a nutritious
blend of unbleached flour.

00:01:01.812 --> 00:01:04.128
Catelli adds vitamins too.

00:01:04.128 --> 00:01:06.740
- Which is now considered
this horrible gluten-filled,

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:09.930
carb-filled evil with sugar in it.

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:13.770
Bran muffins, which are
really just like small cakes,

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:15.210
were considered superfoods.

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:18.000
Other things, such as frozen yogurt,

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.720
was considered a superfood
in the '80s and '90s

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.124
because it was healthier than ice cream.

00:01:24.124 --> 00:01:26.922
- [Announcer] Delicious
TCBY nonfat frozen yogurt.

00:01:26.922 --> 00:01:29.390
What a great tasting way
to help you lose weight.

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:32.980
- Although it does have
pretty much as many calories,

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.640
as much fat, and as much sugar.

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:37.590
So superfoods of one day
are gonna be different

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:39.550
from superfoods down the line,

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:41.700
but they're not
necessarily much healthier.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.270
I think a lot of the superfoods
of today are the things

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:45.460
that are hard to pronounce.

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:48.560
So the harder it is to
pronounce, the better it is.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:51.640
so something like turmeric or quinoa,

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:54.300
a lot of the berries, goji
berries are a new one.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:55.600
We talked about blueberries

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:58.270
and raspberries a few
years ago being superfoods.

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:01.560
Now we have acai as another superfood.

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.330
Again, these are harder to pronounce.

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:05.320
Those are sorta the newer superfoods.

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:07.870
I think as far as should we
be eating a certain superfood,

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:09.310
are we missing out?

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:10.400
Not necessarily.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:13.240
I think, again, if you wanna eat healthy,

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:17.500
eat berries, eat healthy
grains, eat a balanced diet,

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:22.240
and that will give you enough
nutrition, antioxidants,

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:25.110
vitamins as any superfood would give you.

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:28.120
People have the false notion
that if they're eating a lot

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.340
of superfoods in high quantities

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:32.540
that that will keep them healthy

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.240
and they don't need to do other things

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:36.100
to take care of their health.

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.830
So if you're eating a lot of superfoods

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:41.060
but you don't get a flu vaccine,

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.980
that doesn't mean you're
not going to get the flu.

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:46.140
If you're eating a lot of superfoods

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:50.190
and you don't get basic cancer
screening based on your age,

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.450
that will not prevent cancer.

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:56.570
So I think there's some
danger in eating superfoods

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.220
in that you think that that's going

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.553
to be the be-all, end-all
of your healthcare.

